    "long_instructions": "##Designer Mindset\r\n###Step 1: Generate HTML\r\n- Upload your wireframe from the previous level. Prompt AI with structured recipe:\r\n\t- “_Generate HTML for a page with [header], [nav bar items], [main content area], [footer]._”\r\n- Compare AI output to wireframe.\r\n- Use Revision Checklist to record matches/mismatches (_in Activity Guide_).\r\n- Save as **Version 1**\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Generate CSS\r\n-\tPrompt AI to customize your website with CSS.\r\n\r\n-\tSave as **Version 2**\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Iterate\r\n- Human-centered design takes many attempts to get the final product just right.\r\n- Take as much or as little time to get your site just right!\r\n\r\n### Need more support? \r\nWatch the video tutorial in the next level.",
